```mermaid
flowchart TD
    %% Edge + ingress
    U[Users/Clients] -->|HTTPS| CA[Cloud Armor + LB/API Gateway]
    CA --> CRI[Cloud Run Ingress]

    %% Compute
    subgraph CloudRun[Cloud Run Services]
        GW[gateway/nginx]
        AS[appointment-service]
        AV[availability-service]
        NS[notification-service]
    end
    CRI --> GW
    GW --> AS
    GW --> AV
    GW --> NS

    %% Data plane
    subgraph Data[Data Stores]
        SQL[(Cloud SQL Postgres<br/>Regional, private IP)]
        REDIS[(Memorystore Redis)]
        SEARCH[(Elastic Cloud on GCP/OpenSearch)]
        LOGS[(Cloud Logging/Storage)]
    end
    AS <-->|SQL/Transactions| SQL
    AV -->|Reads| SQL
    AS <-->|Cache/Holds/Idempotency| REDIS
    AV <-->|Cache Availability| REDIS
    AS -->|Index providers| SEARCH
    GW -->|Access Logs| LOGS

    %% Events
    subgraph Events[Messaging/Eventing]
        PS[Pub/Sub Topics]
    end
    AS --> PS
    PS --> NS
    PS -->|Audit/Analytics| LOGS

    %% Observability & secrets
    AS -->|Logs/Metrics/Traces| O11Y[Cloud Logging/Monitoring/Trace]
    AV -->|Logs/Metrics/Traces| O11Y
    NS -->|Logs/Metrics/Traces| O11Y
    GW -->|Logs/Metrics| O11Y
    CloudRun -.->|Service Accounts| SA[IAM Service Accounts]
    CloudRun -.->|Secrets/Config| SM[Secret Manager]
```
